---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { shared } from '../../i18n/content.js';
const wa = `https://wa.me/${shared.whatsapp}`;
---

<BaseLayout lang="en">
  <main class="shell py-20 md:py-28" style="--max: 46rem;">
    <a href="/en/" class="text-label text-greige transition-colors hover:text-porcelain">← Back to site</a>

    <h1 class="mt-8 font-display text-h-md font-semibold text-porcelain">Privacy & Cookies Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-label text-greige">Last updated: November 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-body text-greige">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h-sm font-medium text-porcelain">1. Who is responsible</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Siulverse is the personal brand of Luis Lovera, providing design, motion and content services. For any question about your data, reach us on <a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-porcelain underline underline-offset-4">WhatsApp</a> or through the site's contact form.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h-sm font-medium text-porcelain">2. What data we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-porcelain">Contact form:</strong> your name, email and the message you write, so we can reply.<br /><strong class="text-porcelain">Site usage:</strong> aggregated browsing data (page views, traffic source) via Google Analytics 4 — only if you accept cookies.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h-sm font-medium text-porcelain">3. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We use analytics cookies (Google Analytics 4) <strong class="text-porcelain">only after your consent</strong> in the notice shown on your first visit. If you decline, the site works the same and no analytics cookie is set. To change your choice, clear the site data in your browser and the notice will appear again.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h-sm font-medium text-porcelain">4. Purpose and legal basis</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We use your data to reply to your contact and to understand site usage and improve it. The legal basis is <strong class="text-porcelain">your consent</strong>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h-sm font-medium text-porcelain">5. Who we share it with</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Form submissions are processed by <strong class="text-porcelain">Web3Forms</strong>, which forwards the message to our email. Usage analytics is handled by <strong class="text-porcelain">Google Analytics</strong>. We do not sell or rent your data to third parties.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h-sm font-medium text-porcelain">6. How long we keep it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We keep your message for as long as needed to reply and follow up. Analytics data follows Google Analytics' standard retention periods.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h-sm font-medium text-porcelain">7. Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">You can request access, correction or deletion of your data at any time. Just reach us on <a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-porcelain underline underline-offset-4">WhatsApp</a> or through the form.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h-sm font-medium text-porcelain">8. Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We may update this policy. The date at the top shows the current version.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
